<title>USA: Elegant Illusions Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Elegant Illusions Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PACIFIC GROVE, Calif. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elegant  Illusions Inc Wednesday said it earned $83,861 on revenues of $1,907,399 in the first quarter compared to income of $47,778 on revenues of $1,379,614 during the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Same store sales increased by 15 percent for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
